    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that sounds nice in theory but it's just talk. the world doesn't care about my \"perspective.\" the world cares about efficiency and output. in any other system, when a component is redundant and takes up resources without adding value, it's decommissioned. it's just cleaner that way. why should a human be any different?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
